य: स सर्वेषु भूतेषु नश्यत्सु न विनश्यति ॥ २० ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":2482,\"bb\":2198,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/8/20/b2198/\",\"body_value\":\"paras tasmāt tu bhāvo ’nyo
